      "text": "The refund that POL-RD-02 produces on this record is SGD 165.92 — charged_total of SGD 224.12 less the recomputed fare of SGD 58.20 — and that figure exceeds the SGD 150.00 ceiling in POL-RD-10(6). On that trigger the Judge must NOT issue a monetary ruling: the case escalates to a human reviewer with no money moving, and the disputed amount is held rather than refunded. Escalation is terminal and replaces the ruling under POL-GEN-03, which is the outcome the driver seeks here: the fare_breakdown shows payment_status CHARGED and refund_issued_sgd 0.00, so escalation preserves the present payment state instead of converting it into a SGD 165.92 payout.",
