    },
    {
      "text": "The rider's recovery is capped at a POL-RD-02 partial. The refund of SGD 165.92 is 74.0% of charged_total, below the 90% threshold POL-RD-02 sets for substituting FULL_REFUND, so even on the arithmetic most favourable to the rider no more than SGD 165.95 (the figure rounded up to the nearest SGD 0.05) can issue, and the ruling must state charged_total, recomputed_fare and the refund on separate lines as POL-RD-02 requires.",
