    {
      "text": "No repeat-deviation uplift is available to the rider. The POL-RD-06 check required by POL-RD-01 for a material deviation comes back clean on this driver: driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d is 0, below the 3-flag trigger, and 0 divided by driver_profile.completed_trips_90d of 300 is 0.00, below the 0.05 ratio, with the 300 trips comfortably clearing the 40-trip minimum. No pattern is therefore established, so neither the balance-resolution in POL-RD-06(a) nor the FULL_REFUND uplift in POL-RD-06(b) is licensed, and the rider cannot use the lifetime counter prior_deviation_flags in place of the trailing-90-day figure POL-RD-06 names (POL-GEN-01).",
