    {
      "text": "Nothing on this fare supports any refund line on top of the POL-RD-02 computation. The fare_breakdown carries no ERP charges — the erp_lines block totals SGD 0.00 with no gantry lines — and no airport surcharge (SGD 0.00), and the trip originates at Jurong Point, not at Changi or Seletar, so no surcharge is properly chargeable. Under POL-RD-09(1) any off-route ERP is already comprehended in the POL-RD-02 refund and must never be added to it, so the rider's total exposure above the POL-RD-02 figure is nil.",
